---
import { getPostCount } from '../lib/site';

const postCount = await getPostCount();
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="border-t border-hairline bg-surface/40">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-16 sm:px-8 sm:py-20">

    <!-- Two primary CTA boxes: the two main tasks -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 md:grid-cols-2">
      <a href="/blog/" class="group border border-hairline p-6 transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-accent/75 sm:p-8">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-white sm:text-2xl">Read the blog</h3>
          <!-- Tabler: arrow-right — slides right on hover -->
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-5 text-ink-faint transition duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:text-accent/75" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M5 12l14 0"/><path d="M13 18l6 -6"/><path d="M13 6l6 6"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <!-- AI-GENERATED PLACEHOLDER COPY (from design prototype) — Aaron rewrites -->
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-dim">
          Two decades and {postCount} entries on programming, business, and
          management. The lessons stuck around; so did I.
        </p>
      </a>
      <a href="/contact/" class="group border border-hairline p-6 transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-accent/75 sm:p-8">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-white sm:text-2xl">Say hello</h3>
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-5 text-ink-faint transition duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:text-accent/75" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M5 12l14 0"/><path d="M13 18l6 -6"/><path d="M13 6l6 6"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <!-- AI-GENERATED PLACEHOLDER COPY (from design prototype) — Aaron rewrites -->
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-dim">
          Find out if we can work together, or just tell me your
          best production-outage story. I answer both.
        </p>
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Brand mark -->
    <div class="mt-14">
      <img src="/logo.svg" class="h-8 w-auto" alt="AS logo" />
    </div>

    <!-- Sitemap-style link columns -->
    <div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-2 gap-8 text-sm sm:grid-cols-4">
      <div>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ink-faint">Site</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2">
          <li><a href="/" class="opacity-60 transition-opacity duration-300 hover:opacity-100">Home</a></li>
          <li><a href="/who-am-i/" class="opacity-60 transition-opacity duration-300 hover:opacity-100">Who am I</a></li>
          <li><a href="/cv/" class="opacity-60 transition-opacity duration-300 hover:opacity-100">CV</a></li>
          <li><a href="/blog/" class="opacity-60 transition-opacity duration-300 hover:opacity-100">Blog</a></li>
          <li><a href="/books/" class="opacity-60 transition-opacity duration-300 hover:opacity-100">Books</a></li>
          <li><a href="/contact/" class="opacity-60 transition-opacity duration-300 hover:opacity-100">Contact</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ink-faint">Find Me</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2">
          <li><a href="https://github.com/aaronsaray" class="opacity-60 transition-opacity duration-300 hover:opacity-100">GitHub</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://codepen.io/aaronsaray" class="opacity-60 transition-opacity duration-300 hover:opacity-100">CodePen</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://linkedin.com/in/aaronsaray" class="opacity-60 transition-opacity duration-300 hover:opacity-100">LinkedIn</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://twitter.com/aaronsaray" class="opacity-60 transition-opacity duration-300 hover:opacity-100">Twitter</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ink-faint">Projects</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2">
          <li><a href="https://show.nocompromises.io" class="opacity-60 transition-opacity duration-300 hover:opacity-100">Laravel Podcast</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://learnthephoneticalphabet.com" class="opacity-60 transition-opacity duration-300 hover:opacity-100">Learn the Phonetic Alphabet</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://typesetter.io" class="opacity-60 transition-opacity duration-300 hover:opacity-100">Typesetter.io</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ink-faint">Other Sites</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2">
          <li><a href="https://morebetterfaster.io" class="opacity-60 transition-opacity duration-300 hover:opacity-100">More Better Faster</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://masteringlaravel.io" class="opacity-60 transition-opacity duration-300 hover:opacity-100">Mastering Laravel</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://1lastcheck.com" class="opacity-60 transition-opacity duration-300 hover:opacity-100">1lastcheck</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom meta row: legal left, feed right — same tier of info -->
    <div class="mt-14 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 border-t border-hairline pt-6 text-xs text-ink-faint">
      <p>&copy; {year} Aaron Saray. Licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0.</p>
      <a href="/blog/index.xml" class="flex items-center gap-1.5 opacity-80 transition-opacity duration-300 hover:opacity-100">
        <!-- Tabler: rss -->
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 19m-1 0a1 1 0 1 0 2 0a1 1 0 1 0 -2 0"/><path d="M4 4a16 16 0 0 1 16 16"/><path d="M4 11a9 9 0 0 1 9 9"/></svg>
        RSS
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
